OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with possession of
OL,4,ASemtex near Irish boder granted bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dublin museum employee charged over
OL,7,Fthe seizure of a Semtex explosive
OL,8,Fdevice which was described as capable
OL,9,Fof causing "catastrophic damage and
OL,10,Fserious loss of life", has been granted
OL,11,FbB,40,000 (#34,000) bail.
OL,13,FSimon O'Donovan, 44, of Sperrin Road in
OL,14,FDublin 12 was previously remanded in
OL,15,Fcustody.
OL,17,FHowever, on Tuesday he was granted bail
OL,18,Fduring a hearing at the High Court,
OL,19,Fwhich heard that he was a member of the
OL,20,Fdissident-aligned republican group
OL,21,FSaoradh.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
