OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with possession of
OL,4,ASemtex near Irish boder granted bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Garda (Irish police) Special
OL,7,FDetective Unit (SDU) officer objected
OL,8,Fto bail, voicing concerns that
OL,9,FO'Donovan "would continue to engage in
OL,10,Foperational activities to further the
OL,11,Faims of New IRA".
